sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Student (rider)
    participant SS as :Ride Search Screen
    participant RM as :Ride Request Manager
    participant RO as :RideOffer
    participant RF as :Ride Request Form
    participant RQ as :RideRequest
    participant CS as :Request Confirmation Screen

    Note over R,CS: Step 2 - Search for matching rides
    R->>SS: (1) enter pickup, destination, date, time
    SS->>RM: 2.1 send search criteria
    RM->>RO: 2.2 find ride offers matching criteria
    RO-->>RM: matching ride offers (may be none)
    RM->>SS: 2.3 display matching ride offers (or "no matches found")

    Note over R,CS: Steps 3-5 - Rider chooses to create a request and fills the form
    R->>RF: (5) enter trip details and submit

    Note over R,CS: Step 6 - Validate and save the ride request
    RF->>RM: 6.1 send trip details
    RM->>RQ: 6.2 validate required trip details
    RQ-->>RM: valid (or list of missing fields)
    RM->>RQ: 6.3 save request with status open, owned by the rider

    Note over R,CS: Step 8 - Confirm the request and make it visible to drivers
    R->>CS: (7) view submitted request
    CS->>RM: 8.1 request the saved ride request
    RM->>RQ: 8.2 retrieve request and status
    RQ-->>RM: request details, status open
    RM->>RQ: 8.3 keep status open so eligible drivers can find it
    RM->>CS: 8.4 display confirmation that request is posted
